      "Feasibility and Development Plan": "• High feasibility – mobile app development is a well-established process. The phased approach with a pilot program is smart.",
      "Revenue Model and Sustainability": "• Good revenue potential – freemium model allows for broad reach. Premium features and integrations offer opportunities for scaling.",
